        "subject": "LU-20455 utils: report changed .ltsh subtests in changed.py",
        "message": "LU-20455 utils: report changed .ltsh subtests in changed.py\n\nSubtests can now be kept in lustre/tests/SUITE.d/*.ltsh files instead\nof in SUITE.sh.  changed.py previously only looked at run_test lines\nin lustre/tests/*.sh, so a new or changed subtest in a .ltsh file, or\none moved there from SUITE.sh, was not reported in updated_tests and\nwas not repeated by the subtest-change test sessions.\n\nReport every test_N() function of a changed .ltsh file under its\nSUITE, merged with those found in SUITE.sh.  The files are small, so\nthere is no need to find which subtest a change belongs to.  None are\nreported for a deleted file.\n\nThis changes nothing until .ltsh files exist.  The output for the\nlast 30 master commits that change lustre/tests is unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I0c18723a0623fb31e13e9c28f5da400a3a3ebbe5\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/70050\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Charlie Olmstead <charlie@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Jin Gwoun <jgwoun@ddn.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
